  "limitations": [
    "161 assertions per guest: 35 lease, 28 reader, 45 ACL, 43 publication and 10 filesystem; five native and nine unit parent tests plus 57 distinct codec subtests execute without skips.",
    "Root-owned system-storage fixtures establish actual publication on the 15.1 ZFS root and 14.5 UFS root. Actual new inode/old descriptor bytes, canonical checksum/identity/revision and private owner/mode/link checks pass; exact cooperating expected revisions serialize one successful update.",
    "Separate newly owned 32 MiB memory-backed UFS mounts qualify actual ENOSPC and read-only publication refusal, unchanged prior record, owned temporary cleanup and masked POSIX named-grant refusal/preservation. Test-only ACL writes, filling and mounting occur inside the disposable guest; no operator disk or host mount is used.",
    "Transaction seams inject phase errors around real native fixtures to qualify ordering/accounting, not actual device/kernel EIO, abrupt helper death, guest reboot/power-cut or durable job acknowledgements. Visible replacement after failed final directory sync blocks further publication on the lease; bounded reads remain available. Cleanup errors also retain uncertainty.",
    "Actual dropped UID/GID 65534 with inherited root directory/lock descriptors and no privileged supplementary groups is refused for publication by the existing native reader process probe. No product helper enrollment/IPC/executor integration follows.",
    "No total store/enumeration/byte budget, stale temporary discovery/recovery, job history/tombstones/admission/reservation, metadata export/restore or persistent uncertain-write barrier is implemented. Reopening this primitive is not retry authority. Runtime remains read-only.",
    "Observed metadata/ACL drift checks are not a malicious-root fence or guarantee against every synchronized external ACL race. Native I/O deadlines and arbitrary non-default ZFS ACL publication are unqualified.",
    "All owned handles/mounts/memory devices/fixtures are closed/removed; host image/key/variables absent, base/runtime preserved and supervised groups stopped. No persistent runner/service; GitHub Actions remain disabled.",
    "Prior accepted manifests retain exact bytes, commits and case sets; this expanded suite does not relabel earlier device/property proof. Pinned primary sources establish interface semantics, not installed binary provenance or physical controller/cache honesty.",
    "M2 acceptance, full storage operations and maintainer-deferred M1 Safari/manual accessibility remain open. No physical/commercial support or external client/share behavior follows. Final documentation-head review is separate with unchanged functional/test/tool hashes."
  ]
